## Recording a new dependency

1. Identify the exact licence and copyright holder.
2. Confirm GPL-3.0-or-later compatibility.
3. Record any attribution or source-offer requirement here and in the application UI where required.
4. Note any local modifications to third-party source.
5. Update dependency hashes through Gradle dependency verification.
